== CHAPTER 3: The Shared Hunt and the Balance Scale of Justice
<chapter-3-the-shared-hunt-and-the-balance-scale-of-justice>
#quote_box[
#emph[“Nothing resembles justice more closely than a straight wooden
beam suspended from its exact midpoint, whose two arms refuse to tilt in
