=== Key Takeaways
<key-takeaways-3>
+ To execute vertical operations, align #strong[ones under ones] and
  #strong[tens under tens]. Compute from right to left.
+ #strong[In addition], if the sum of ones reaches 10 or greater, write
  down the ones digit and send the ten as a #strong[carry] to the top of
  the tens column.
+ Always include the carry when summing the tens column.
+ #strong[In subtraction], if the top digit is smaller than the bottom
  digit, #strong[decompose a ten]: the tens column loses 1, and the ones
  column gains 10.
+ Verify subtractions by adding the difference back to the subtracted
  amount.

#divider()

