    [], [], [], [#strong[3]], [#strong[.]], [#strong[4]], [#strong[7]], [],
  )]
  , kind: table
  )

Look at this number: #strong[$3.47$]. It consists of two distinct
territories:

#align(center)[
  #block(
    fill: rgb("#f8fafc"),
    stroke: 1pt + rgb("#cbd5e1"),
    inset: (x: 16pt, y: 10pt),
