=== 7. Beware of Pitfalls!
<beware-of-pitfalls-2>
#alerte(title: [Attention au Piège !])[
#strong[⚠️ Warning: Monumental Exponent Blunders!
]
 1. #strong[The
Phantom Exponent Addition Trap:] $ 10^2 + 10^3 eq.not 10^5 quad ! $
Powers can NEVER be added by adding their exponents!
$10^2 + 10^3 = 100 + 1\,000 = 1\,100$, whereas $10^5 = 100\,000$. 2.
#strong[The Minus Sign and Parentheses Trap:]
$ - 3^2 = -\(3 times 3\)= upright(bold(- 9)) $
$ \(- 3\)^2 =\(- 3\)times\(- 3\)= upright(bold(+ 9)) $ Without grouping
parentheses, the exponent applies ONLY to the base number 3, not to the
preceding minus sign! 3. #strong[Non-Standard Scientific Format:]

- $35 times 10^4$ is #strong[not] in scientific notation because
  $35 gt.eq 10$ (must be written $3.5 times 10^5$).
- $0.7 times 10^(- 3)$ is #strong[not] in scientific notation because
  $0.7 < 1$ (must be written $7 times 10^(- 4)$).

#block[
#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 4)
+ #strong[Multiplying Bases Instead of Adding Exponents:]
  $ 2^3 times 2^4 eq.not 4^7 quad upright("correct is") quad 2^(3 + 4) = 2^7 = 128 $
]
]

