=== What You Must Remember
<what-you-must-remember-3>
+ #strong[Order of Operations (PEMDAS):] Parentheses $arrow.r$ Exponents
  $arrow.r$ Multiplication & Division (left to right) $arrow.r$ Addition
  & Subtraction (left to right).

+ #strong[Definition of Powers:]
  $a^n = underbrace(a times a times dots.h times a, n upright(" times"))$\;
  $a^1 = a$\; $a^0 = 1$ ($a eq.not 0$).

+ #strong[Negative Exponents:] $a^(- n) = 1 / a^n$\;
  $10^(- n) = 1 / 10^n = 0.00 dots.h 01$ ($n$ total zeros).

+ #strong[Exponent Calculation Rules:]

  - $a^m times a^n = a^(m + n)$

  - $a^m / a^n = a^(m - n)$

  - $\(a^m\)^n = a^(m times n)$

  - $\(a times b\)^n = a^n times b^n$

+ #strong[Scientific Notation:] Standard format: $a times 10^n$ with
  $1 lt.eq a < 10$ (exactly one non-zero digit before the decimal
  point).

