=== 2. The Right Triangle and Its Treasure: The Hypotenuse
<the-right-triangle-and-its-treasure-the-hypotenuse>
Before reliving the intellectual tragedy of Hippasus, let us explore the
royal figure of geometry: the #strong[right-angled triangle].

#align(center)[
  #block(
    fill: rgb("#f8fafc"),
    stroke: 1pt + rgb("#cbd5e1"),
    inset: (x: 16pt, y: 10pt),
