=== 1. The Problem: The Treasure Map and the Anxiety of the Circle
<the-problem-the-treasure-map-and-the-anxiety-of-the-circle>
Imagine that you have just rowed ashore onto an uninhabited tropical
island in the Indian Ocean. Clutched in your trembling hand is the
brittle, yellowed parchment of a buccaneer. The ink has faded from sea
salt and humidity, but you manage to decipher these few quill-drawn
words: #emph[“The brass-bound chest of gold coins lies buried at exactly
50 meters from the solitary black standing stone that towers above the
beach.”]

Your heart pounds. You dash toward the black standing stone. You plant
your heels against the volcanic rock, face the palm grove, pace out 50
meters, plunge your shovel into the sand, and begin digging feverishly.
You dig for an hour under a blistering sun. Nothing! Not a single coin,
only crushed coral.

You stop, drenched in sweat, as the chilling mathematical truth dawns on
you: The pirate wrote: #emph[“at 50 meters from the standing stone.”]
But in which direction?

- 50 meters to the North?
- 50 meters to the East, into the crashing ocean surf?
- 50 meters to the West, beneath the tangled roots of a giant banyan
  tree?

