#strong[Solution 26.6] Let $M$ be a point. Reflection across $\(d_1\)$
maps $M$ to $M_1$\; reflection across $\(d_2\)$ maps $M_1$ to $M'$.
Since $\(d_1\)perp\(d_2\)$, the coordinates show that $O$ is the
