are $65^compose\,45^compose\,70^compose$. In $triangle.stroked.t R S T$:
$hat(R) = 65^compose\,hat(T) = 70^compose arrow.r.double.long hat(S) = 180^compose -\(65^compose + 70^compose\)= 45^compose$.
All three pairs of angles match: the triangles are #strong[similar] by
