($90^compose$) and an equal angle of incidence/reflection
($accent(S M A, ̂) = accent(P M S, ̂)$). By AA, they are #strong[similar].
\2. Ratio:
$ upright("Tree Height") / upright("Arthur Eye Height") = upright("Mirror to Tree") / upright("Mirror to Arthur") arrow.r.double.long h / 1.60 = 12 / 2 = 6 . $
$ h = 1.60 times 6 = 9.60 upright(" meters") . $

