=== The Question Opening the Next Chapter
<the-question-opening-the-next-chapter-5>
Through Euclid's arithmetic, everything is governed with absolute
certainty: every stone finds its place, every share divides evenly,
every calculation is rock solid. Yet our real world is not merely
composed of sealed chests and square marble slabs.

What happens when the mist of the future rises, when dice roll across an
innkeeper's table, or when a caravan master must choose between two
perilous routes? Can one calculate rationally in the face of
uncertainty? Journey into the desert and the salons of 17th-century
thinkers: we will learn to master the #strong[roulette of fate] in
Chapter 30: #strong[The Roulette of Fate and the Hunter's Survival].

