=== 1. The Problem: The Caravan and the Forest of Two Paths
<the-problem-the-caravan-and-the-forest-of-two-paths>
Dusk is falling over the Silk Road. A caravan of ten camels loaded with
bales of precious spices and fine silks halts at the edge of an immense,
dark, and misty forest. To reach the oasis where the grand annual market
is being held, the caravan master must choose between two routes:

