interrupted. 1. At most, how many additional rounds would have been
necessary to complete the game? 2. Draw the tree of remaining rounds
assuming each round is equally likely ($P = 1\/2$). 3. What is the
probability that Player $B$ stages a comeback and wins the game? 4. How
should the 100 pistoles be fairly divided between $A$ and $B$?

