#strong[\9.] Place an orthonormal coordinate system with origin $D$,
$\(D A\)$ along the $x$-axis, and $\(D C\)$ along the $y$-axis.
$D\(0\;0\)$, $A\(3\;0\)$, $B\(3\;6\)$, $C\(0\;6\)$. The midpoint $I$ of
