  $#box(stroke: black, inset: 3pt, [$ M_e = 10 $])$.

- #strong[First Quartile $Q_1$:] $N / 4 = 20 / 4 = 5$. $Q_1$ is the 5th
  value in the sorted list. Ranks 3 through 6 are 8. Thus
  $#box(stroke: black, inset: 3pt, [$ Q_1 = 8 $])$.

- #strong[Third Quartile $Q_3$:] $frac(3 N, 4) = 60 / 4 = 15$. $Q_3$ is
  the 15th value. Ranks 13 through 17 are 12. Thus
  $#box(stroke: black, inset: 3pt, [$ Q_3 = 12 $])$.

