#strong[Exercise 16.] Cayley-Hamilton Theorem in Dimension 2. Let
$A = mat(delim: "(", a, b; c, d)$. Define its trace
$upright("Tr")\(A\)= a + d$ and its determinant $det\(A\)= a d - b c$.
