=== 5. The Higher Education Horizon: What Awaits You Now
<the-higher-education-horizon-what-awaits-you-now>
This book concludes at the threshold of secondary school completion and
intellectual maturity. Yet what you have mastered is not the summit of
the mountain: #strong[it is base camp]. Here are the five great
continents you will explore in higher education (University Mathematics,
Engineering Schools, and Advanced Sciences):

#principe(title: [Définition Fondamentale])[
#strong[📐 Règle Fondamentale --- Synthèse de l'Édifice Mathématique et
Cap sur le Supérieur
]


- HIGHER EDUCATION
- ABSTRACT LINEAR ALGEBRA \] \[ TOPOLOGY \] \[ COMPLEX ANALYSIS \]
