  functions
- infinite dimensions (Hilbert, abstract continuity, of a complex
  variable:
- Banach). Inner products, compactness, completeness.the Cauchy miracle.
- spectral theory & eigenvalues.Beyond classical metrics. Residues,
  analytic continuation,
- Riemann Hypothesis.
- MEASURE THEORY & \] \[ DIFFERENTIAL GEOMETRY \]
- CONTINUOUS PROBABILITY Curvature of surfaces,
