$u_(n + 1) - u_n = frac(1, n + 1) - ln\(n + 1\)+ ln\(n\)= frac(1, n + 1) - integral_n^(n + 1) 1 / t d t lt.eq 0$
by the earlier inequality. The sequence is non-increasing and bounded
