=== Epilogue
<epilogue>
You have reached the end of this book. The seed planted twelve years ago
has grown into a sturdy tree, its roots anchored in the physical gesture
of the body and its branches reaching toward infinity. Take a moment to
measure what you have accomplished. And always remember: Mathematics is
not a system of arbitrary rules to be obeyed. It is #strong[the highest
poetry of pure thought, and the greatest song of freedom of the human
mind.] May your journey into new discoveries be filled with wonder!



